    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$loading_intro",
            "key": "$loading_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oakley",
        "text": "N-No, sir! Of course not!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "Whatever, I'm just here to hand over some stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oakley",
        "text": "That's a lot of papers. Are these records and investigation forms? And the name on them\u2014Ferne Barn?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "Vandalizing public property, theft of cultural relics, trespassing, impersonating a guide... why's a little indie guide worth your trouble to scrutinize five years of work history?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "We just need your signature down here, and you'll spend the rest of your life in jail introducing folks to handcuffs and shackles."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "What do you want?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "The expo's about to begin, but we need more hands on deck. We can't afford to lock up the park's only two guides, that would waste time and resources."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "But there are too many records with your name on them, <i>and</i> you're connected to Nasti Lunorey."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "So you've decided to threaten me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "Stay in line, and this is a chance to wipe your rap sheets clean, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "Seems like I don't have a choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "Save your thanks for Gustave. He was the one who proposed it to the Maylander Emergency Management Council. The two of you would be missing out on this expo marking the beginning of a new era without him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "I'm sure you heard the broadcast too. Before the park plate drives into the intercity net's range and begins the live stream, make sure you're fully prepared to introduce the future to every Columbian out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ferne",
        "text": "I get it. I'll finish all the studio work, and won't leave the park before the expo ends."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "Good deal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Propeller Paradise Police",
        "text": "Then come on out, you two. Time to get to work."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
