    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "'On behalf of all Leithanians, I express my most sincere congratulations for the upcoming Air Expo Columbia to be held on the experimental Propeller Paradise.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Take a guess, who signed it in the end?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Conductor of the G\u00fcldenes...gesatz, uh, Guardian of the Nine Kreise... anyway, one with a string of titles neither of us could pronounce\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "The Kaiserin."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "The late Maylander Sr. always said those with a keen sense for politics never lose it, and it seems that holds true."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Miss Wilson."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_highheelfts"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "I'd rather keep a keen sense for wine-tasting, honestly."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Laterano took half a century to hold their Summit of Nations, an event you could say was the largest diplomatic event on Terra in nearly two centuries, yet Leithanien only sent over a few insignificant dukes as delegates."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "But our tiny Air Expo Columbia has got a personal letter of congratulations from the Kaiserin..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$doorknockquite"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vice President's Secretary",
        "text": "Mr. Vice President, Propeller Paradise has sent over a gift. A bunch of balloons in the shape of the President, most of which are already decorating the hallways."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Thank you, Pavard."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "Perhaps you could return the Kaiserin's wishes with a balloon like that one?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "And let the Gesatzsw\u00e4chter and Spire Casters spend three days carefully dismantling it into rubber scrap?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "It seems to be an average balloon for decorative purposes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "I fear that is no longer the case, since the letter was penned by the Kaiserin. It'll 'transform' into the most cutting-edge military tech\u2014an aerial bomb disguised as a balloon, sent floating into another country's airspace."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "And how many congratulations like that have you received?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Let's see. Victorian Grand Dukes, the Ursine Speaker, the Grand Knight of Kazimierz... I'll run out of fingers to count on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "The VP before me spent four years worrying about immigration and tariffs, but me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Impregnable cities got captured, a never-changing sky got ripped open, and a long-silent ocean began to speak."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "After all that, the core nations unanimously decided 'balloons are always aerial bombs in disguise'."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "And what about us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Oh, this balloon of ours can't even fly."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vice President's Secretary",
        "text": "Before the balloons were sent over, the flammable hydrogen got replaced with regular air... for safety reasons, of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "How safe and careful we Columbians are."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "This sounds like a serious matter of national security, but you're discussing it with a retiree...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "Inside the State Building, the finest reception hall in all of D.C., even?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "It's hard to imagine retirement making things any different for Jara Booker Wilson."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "My hospitality is hardly befitting the once Eternally Shining Star, or Rhine Lab's former Director of HR."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "These days, people seem more willing to be moved by a legend or miracle than by politics or promises."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Even the most rational congressmen are no exception."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "If you're referring to the few meetings I had with Congressman Wayne, I believe you've already expressed your gratitude... with those unique souvenirs from Kjerag."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "That was just a personal token of my gratitude. Besides, I later realized the scientists at the observation station must have sent you something similar before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "If you show up and give the right people the chance to put hydrogen back into Columbia's balloons, I'm sure I won't be the only one in line to thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "To my understanding, the most suitable people to do it would be those who made the balloon in the first place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "I've stepped in on their behalf quite a few times."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "Researchers are as sincere as children. I can never bear to see their hopes dashed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "You're right that retirement has made no difference to me whatsoever, though."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_897_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jackson",
        "text": "Of course, we all know how important Rhine is to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1840_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "Look. Propeller Paradise... you don't even need binoculars to see it anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jara",
        "text": "We need only wait and see what they'll turn Columbia's balloons into."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
