    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "I remember agents are required to pass a university-level physics fundamentals exam."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "Isn't this park's purpose to push the boundaries of physics itself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "Are you implying those samples and snacks on you are for research purposes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_humaneat"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "(Satisfied chewing)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "Just for disguise purposes. I'm about to buy some fresh cotton candy planets over at platform four\u2014a small vacuum chamber that can simulate the birth and development of Terra... don't you think it romantic?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "At least, that's less boring than having to transport a special someone."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "Special... you mean that Banshee?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "Yeah, the one you were in charge of before."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#7$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "So the Tin Man already knew..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "He said you had an urgent mission to handle, so we'll take over evacuating the special individual."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#10$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "V\u00e6la in bad shape. You'll have to be very careful."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "I know, an old Banshee has to be skilled in witchcraft, no? We'll set up cognitive interference detectors to make sure nothing goes awry."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mercia",
        "text": "Cognitive interference? But she's already being tormented by her shattered memories\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "Man, where my colleagues at? We have to evacuate all park personnel from the levitation layer in the next half hour, or I won't get to buy any souvenirs."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tester?",
        "text": "This is the last chance we'll get to see such weird stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#14$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
