    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "There's still an hour before the broadcast begins. Which necktie should I wear...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "Tch. Is Gustave still deciding who will make the opening speech? Drag it out any longer and we'll have no time to prepare the script!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "An hour won't be enough to list all my countless contributions to the park. There are also the many organizations and departments to thank for all the help they've given me, they deserve the recognition..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "Everything will go as planned, surely...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "What am I thinking!? We may not get along, but there's no way he'll side with a Kuranta he's only known for a few days."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "*sigh* Even at the very end, Gustave never changes. Using every trick up his sleeve to keep his lackeys in line, just to make them do as they're told."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "We're like a bunch of kids. Getting all nervous over a little prize we deserve."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "How come Five-Four's not back yet? Wasn't it supposed to just check the office for any news?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$doorknockquite"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
