    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "stopsound",
        "params": {
            "channel": "xf",
            "fadetime": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "I knew it... I knew it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "After hesitating for so long, he settles on the obvious choice, me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "How much effort did I put in just to snatch the opportunity to transfer here? How much did I have to finagle to climb the ladder from my lowly admin job in six months?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "<i>I'm</i> the chief executive of Propeller Paradise, I'm the only one who can front it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "Oh, he even wrote a speech for me? That sly old fox, never leaves anything to chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "'My fellow Columbians, I am Gordon Tannen, the chief executive of Propeller Paradise. I'm sure I've kept you waiting in front of your screens for some time now.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "'Now, it is with a heavy heart that I announce the official cancellation of Air Expo Columbia. A major accident occurred in the park, and as the one in charge of the place, I bear an undeniable responsibility for this...'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "Wait, an accident? Is this a mistake? This is a\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "A public apology?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
