    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast",
        "text": "Alert! Alert!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast",
        "text": "Patrol complete, letter not obtained. Part of the path has been blocked by a group of Terrans. Based on their travel route, they are presumably heading toward the levitation layer's experiment zone."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "At the same time, detecting several high-powered Originium products on the move, bearing cargo identification tags...",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "They belong to Gordon Tannen.",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gordon",
        "text": "My tags...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$drift_intro",
            "key": "$drift_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "An apology letter, and the news brought back by Five-Four... This is no mischievous prophecy, but indisputable reality."
    },
    {
        "text": "Shock, panic, anger... countless emotions fill Gordon's chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Gustave about to cause an accident? On Propeller Paradise, the expo all of Columbia has been eagerly waiting to see?"
    },
    {
        "text": "For what reason? When did he begin planning this? What sort of pawn is 'Gordon Tannen' to him?"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Apology', 'Amends'\u2014Gordon is all too familiar with these words. Ostracized by his colleagues and driven by his eccentric hobby, he was always 'violating the rules'."
    },
    {
        "text": "The thin sheet of paper before him reflects the cumulation of his work over the past seven years."
    },
    {
        "text": "He wrote hundreds of self-reflection letters during his time at ATAO. He remembers every single time Gustave would demand an apology from him, and how he slid from defiance to compromise."
